<%- include('partials/header') %>

<div class="wrapper">
  <%- include('sidebar') %>

  <div class="container-home">
    <div class="hero-section">
      <h1>Welcome to the Missing Persons Tracker</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">Connecting communities to bring missing loved ones home</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section for How the Platform Can Help -->
    <section class="how-it-helps">
      <h2>How This Platform Can Save Lives</h2>
      <p class="intro-text">When a person goes missing, every second counts. This platform brings together a community that can help bring people home safely. Here's how:</p>

      <div class="help-details">
        <div class="help-item">
          <div class="help-image-container">
            <img src="https://blog.ipleaders.in/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/R-1.jpg" alt="Community Involvement" class="help-image">
          </div>
          <div class="help-content">
            <h3>Community Involvement</h3>
            <p>Community involvement plays a critical role in locating missing persons. By sharing information, searching for clues, and raising awareness, we create a network that makes it easier to find those who are lost. This platform empowers everyone to contribute to the search.</p>
            <p>Locating a missing person requires quick action and collaboration. This platform allows the community to play a pivotal role by sharing information, volunteering time, and spreading awareness. Through real-time updates and widespread engagement, the community can act swiftly to assist in locating the missing individual.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="help-item">
          <div class="help-image-container">
            <img src="https://home-affairs.ec.europa.eu/sites/default/files/styles/embed_large/public/2025-02/Community%20for%20European%20Research%20and%20Innovation%20for%20Security%20workshop%20on%20missing%20persons.jpeg?itok=5OAgbWvU" alt="Real-time Information" class="help-image">
          </div>
          <div class="help-content">
            <h3>Real-time Information</h3>
            <p>Our platform provides real-time updates on missing persons cases, allowing the community to act quickly. Every piece of information can lead to a breakthrough, bringing someone home. Being informed about the latest developments increases the chances of finding a person before it's too late.</p>
            <p>Real-time updates ensure that the search for missing persons is as efficient and effective as possible. With notifications and alerts about new developments, users can provide immediate assistance and valuable tips that can make all the difference.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="help-item">
          <div class="help-image-container">
            <img src="https://i.pinimg.com/736x/5b/fb/e0/5bfbe02edce269561d5827728d6371e9.jpg" alt="Sharing Information" class="help-image">
          </div>
          <div class="help-content">
            <h3>Sharing is Caring</h3>
            <p>Sharing cases on social media and within local communities amplifies the reach of the search. The more eyes searching, the higher the chances of finding a missing person. Your shared post might be the crucial link to locating someone.</p>
            <p>By leveraging the power of social media and local networks, the search for missing persons extends far beyond the immediate community. When people share cases, they dramatically increase the visibility of the search, reaching individuals who might have crucial information.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="help-item">
          <div class="help-image-container">
            <img src="https://thewynneprogress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/hero-how-to-spot-fake-poster-1024x747.jpg" alt="Hope for Families" class="help-image">
          </div>
          <div class="help-content">
            <h3>Hope for Families</h3>
            <p>For the families of missing persons, every day without news is unbearable. By participating, you give hope to loved ones that their search will be fruitful and that their missing family member can be safely returned home. The platform offers a ray of hope for families in distress.</p>
            <p>The emotional toll on families of missing persons is unimaginable. Our platform serves as a beacon of hope, offering constant updates, support, and a community ready to help. Every action, from sharing information to following up on leads, provides families with the strength to continue their search.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="inspiration-section">
        <blockquote>
          "Every missing person case is a call for help. Your involvement could be the key to bringing someone home."
        </blockquote>
        <div class="button-container">
          <a href="/search-missing" class="cta-button">Start Searching <i class="fas fa-search"></i></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

<head>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/home.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
</head>

<style>
  /* General Body Styles */
  body {
    font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
    background-color: #f4f6f9;
    color: #333;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .wrapper {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-height: 100vh;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 20px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  /* Hero Section */
  .hero-section {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8d7da, #f4f6f9);
    border-radius: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: #d9534f;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    font-weight: bold;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: #666;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Main container styles */
  .container-home {
    width: 100%;
    background-color: #fff;
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  /* Section styling */
  .how-it-helps {
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .how-it-helps h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: #d9534f;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
  }

  .how-it-helps h2::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 100px;
    height: 3px;
    background-color: #d9534f;
  }

  .intro-text {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.7;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  /* .help-details {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 30px;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }

  .help-item {
    background-color: #f8d7da;
    border-radius: 10px;
    box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  } */

  .help-details {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap; /* Allow items to wrap to the next line */
  gap: 40px;
  margin-top: 30px;
  width: 100%;
}

.help-item {
  background-color: #f8d7da;
  border-radius: 10px;
  box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out;
  overflow: hidden;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  flex: 1 1 calc(50% - 20px); /* This allows each item to take up 50% width minus the gap */
}




  .help-item:hover {
    transform: translateY(-10px);
    box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
  }

  .help-image-container {
    height: 250px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .help-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.5s ease;
  }

  .help-item:hover .help-image {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .help-content {
    padding: 25px;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .help-item h3 {
    color: #d9534f;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .help-item h3::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 50px;
    height: 2px;
    background-color: #d9534f;
  }

  .help-item p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #721c24;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  /* Inspiration Section */
  .inspiration-section {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 60px;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    background-color: #f8f9fa;
    border-radius: 10px;
  }

  blockquote {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #d9534f;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto 40px;
    padding: 0 20px;
    position: relative;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  blockquote::before,
  blockquote::after {
    content: '"';
    font-size: 3rem;
    color: rgba(217, 83, 79, 0.2);
    position: absolute;
  }

  blockquote::before {
    top: -20px;
    left: -10px;
  }

  blockquote::after {
    bottom: -40px;
    right: -10px;
  }

  /* Button Styling */
  .button-container {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 30px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .cta-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    background-color: #d9534f;
    color: white;
    padding: 15px 30px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    min-width: 200px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(217, 83, 79, 0.3);
  }

  .cta-button i {
    margin-left: 10px;
    transition: transform 0.3s;
  }

  .cta-button:hover {
    background-color: #c12e2e;
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(217, 83, 79, 0.4);
  }

  .cta-button:hover i {
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }

  .cta-button.secondary {
    background-color: #5bc0de;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(91, 192, 222, 0.3);
  }

  .cta-button.secondary:hover {
    background-color: #46b8da;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(91, 192, 222, 0.4);
  }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
  .help-details {
    flex-direction: column; /* Stack items in a single column */
    gap: 20px; /* Adjust the gap between items */
  }

  .help-item {
    flex: 1 1 100%; /* Make each item take up 100% width on smaller screens */
  }
}

  /* Responsive adjustments */
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .help-details {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
    
    h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
    }
    
    .hero-subtitle {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }
    
    .how-it-helps h2 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }
    
    .intro-text {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 992px) {
    .wrapper {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 30px;
    }
    
    .container-home {
      margin-left: 30px;
      padding: 40px;
    }
    
    .hero-section {
      padding: 60px 40px;
    }
    
    blockquote {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1200px) {
    .help-details {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    }
    
    h1 {
      font-size: 3.5rem;
    }
    
    .help-content {
      padding: 30px;
    }
    
    .help-item h3 {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
    }
    
    .help-item p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
    
    .cta-button {
      padding: 18px 35px;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }
  }
</style>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>